      <div style="background:#f0f9ff; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius:12px; padding:2rem; margin:2rem 0;"><h3 style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e40af; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Get FMCG Video Intelligence</h3><p style="color:#475569; margin-bottom:1rem;">Projects starting at ₹5L. See your product in real Indian homes. Final quote after scoping call.</p><a href="https://app.analyzeg.co.in/" style="display:inline-block; background:#2563EB; color:#fff; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">Launch App &rarr;</a></div>
